DELETE /client/v4/zones/{zone_id}/load_balancers/{load_balancer_id}
Delete a configured load balancer.
Required: zone_id (path); load_balancer_id (path)

GET /client/v4/zones/{zone_id}/load_balancers/{load_balancer_id}
Fetch a single configured load balancer.
Required: zone_id (path); load_balancer_id (path)

PATCH /client/v4/zones/{zone_id}/load_balancers/{load_balancer_id}
Apply changes to an existing load balancer, overwriting the supplied properties.
Required: zone_id (path); load_balancer_id (path); body (body)

PUT /client/v4/zones/{zone_id}/load_balancers/{load_balancer_id}
Update a configured load balancer.
Required: zone_id (path); load_balancer_id (path); body (body)
